  <div class="wp-faq-item">
    <input type="checkbox" id="wf3" class="wp-faq-toggle">
    <label for="wf3" class="wp-faq-question">Are these tours only for WPATH attendees?<span class="wp-faq-icon">+</span></label>
    <div class="wp-faq-answer">The daytime tours are exclusively for WPATH 2026 attendees. The nightlife events are WPATH-focused but open to others, they're public events and we'll be attending as a group.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="wp-faq-item">
    <input type="checkbox" id="wf4" class="wp-faq-toggle">
    <label for="wf4" class="wp-faq-question">What's included in the price?<span class="wp-faq-icon">+</span></label>
    <div class="wp-faq-answer">All tours include food or tastings, a non-alcoholic drink, and transportation between stops once the tour begins. Getting to the meeting point is your responsibility, we'll send exact location and logistics once your spot is confirmed. The Mezcal tasting includes the mezcal plus snacks. The Lucha Libre price includes arena entrance, tacos, and a non-alcoholic drink. Nightlife events are guest list, register your interest and we'll follow up with full details once confirmed.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="wp-faq-item">
    <input type="checkbox" id="wf5" class="wp-faq-toggle">
    <label for="wf5" class="wp-faq-question">What if my conference schedule changes?<span class="wp-faq-icon">+</span></label>
    <div class="wp-faq-answer">We understand conference schedules can shift. If your schedule changes, we will do our best to move you to another available date, subject to availability. Reach out as soon as you know and we will work something out.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="wp-faq-item">
    <input type="checkbox" id="wf6" class="wp-faq-toggle">
    <label for="wf6" class="wp-faq-question">What is the cancellation policy?<span class="wp-faq-icon">+</span></label>
    <div class="wp-faq-answer">Full refund if cancelled more than 2 weeks in advance. 50% refund between 1 and 2 weeks before the tour. Non-refundable under 1 week. If minimum group size is not reached, you receive a full refund regardless of timing.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="wp-faq-item">
    <input type="checkbox" id="wf7" class="wp-faq-toggle">
    <label for="wf7" class="wp-faq-question">Can I follow you on Instagram?<span class="wp-faq-icon">+</span></label>
    <div class="wp-faq-answer">Yes, follow us at @queerness_experiences_tulum for behind-the-scenes content, tour updates, and queer travel inspiration from Mexico.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="wp-faq-item">
    <input type="checkbox" id="wf8" class="wp-faq-toggle">
    <label for="wf8" class="wp-faq-question">Will I be misgendered in Spanish?<span class="wp-faq-icon">+</span></label>
    <div class="wp-faq-answer">Spanish is a heavily gendered language, so it's possible, especially outside our team. When it happens, it's rarely coming from rejection, it's a language that hasn't caught up with gender-neutral phrasing the way English increasingly has. Our guides are trained to use your pronouns.</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- HOW IT WORKS + REGISTRATION FORM -->
<div class="wp-how" id="register">
  <div class="wp-how-inner">
    <div class="wp-how-eyebrow">The process</div>
    <div class="wp-how-title">How pre-registration works</div>
    <div class="wp-how-steps">
      <div class="wp-how-step">
        <div class="wp-how-num">01</div>
        <div class="wp-how-step-content">
          <div class="wp-how-step-title">Fill out the form below</div>
          <div class="wp-how-step-sub">No cost, no payment required. Tell us which experiences interest you, your dates, and your group size.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="wp-how-step">
        <div class="wp-how-num">02</div>
        <div class="wp-how-step-content">
          <div class="wp-how-step-title">We confirm your group</div>
          <div class="wp-how-step-sub">Once minimum group size is reached we'll reach out to confirm your spot and send payment details.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="wp-how-step">
        <div class="wp-how-num">03</div>
        <div class="wp-how-step-content">
          <div class="wp-how-step-title">Pay to lock in your place</div>
          <div class="wp-how-step-sub">Groups are small and fill up fast. Pre-registering early puts you first in line.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <form class="wp-form" name="wpath-2026" method="POST" data-netlify="true" action="/wpath-2026-thank-you">
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="wpath-2026" />
      <input type="hidden" name="source" value="WPATH2026" />
      <div class="wp-form-row">
        <div><label class="wp-fl">First name</label><input class="wp-fi" type="text" name="first-name" required></div>
        <div><label class="wp-fl">Last name</label><input class="wp-fi" type="text" name="last-name" required></div>
      </div>
      <div><label class="wp-fl">Email</label><input class="wp-fi" type="email" name="email" required></div>
      <div><label class="wp-fl">WhatsApp (include country code)</label><input class="wp-fi" type="tel" name="whatsapp" required></div>
      <div><label class="wp-fl">Pronouns</label><input class="wp-fi" type="text" name="pronouns" required></div>
      <div>
        <label class="wp-fl">Tours — pick a suggested date or type your own. Leave blank if not interested</label>
        <div class="wp-exp-list">
          <div class="wp-exp-row">
            <span class="wp-exp-name-flat">Prehispanic Cooking Class</span>
            <input class="wp-fi wp-exp-select" type="text" name="date-cooking-class" list="dl-cooking-class" placeholder="Pick or type a date" autocomplete="off">
            <datalist id="dl-cooking-class"><option value="Mon Nov 9, morning"></option></datalist>
          </div>
          <div class="wp-exp-row">
            <span class="wp-exp-name-flat">Roma/Condesa Food & Culture Tour</span>
            <input class="wp-fi wp-exp-select" type="text" name="date-roma-condesa" list="dl-roma-condesa" placeholder="Pick or type a date" autocomplete="off">
            <datalist id="dl-roma-condesa"><option value="Tue Nov 10, morning"></option><option value="Wed Nov 11, evening"></option></datalist>
          </div>
          <div class="wp-exp-row">
            <span class="wp-exp-name-flat">San Ángel Market Day</span>
            <input class="wp-fi wp-exp-select" type="text" name="date-san-angel" list="dl-san-angel" placeholder="Pick or type a date" autocomplete="off">
            <datalist id="dl-san-angel"><option value="Sat Nov 7, morning (only date)"></option></datalist>
          </div>
          <div class="wp-exp-row">
            <span class="wp-exp-name-flat">Polanco Mezcal & Snacks</span>
            <input class="wp-fi wp-exp-select" type="text" name="date-mezcal" list="dl-mezcal" placeholder="Pick or type a date" autocomplete="off">
            <datalist id="dl-mezcal"><option value="Fri Nov 6, evening"></option><option value="Sun Nov 8, evening"></option><option value="Wed Nov 11, evening"></option></datalist>
          </div>
          <div class="wp-exp-row">
            <span class="wp-exp-name-flat">Sapphic Shopping & Breakfast City Tour</span>
            <input class="wp-fi wp-exp-select" type="text" name="date-sapphic-shopping" list="dl-sapphic-shopping" placeholder="Pick or type a date" autocomplete="off">
            <datalist id="dl-sapphic-shopping"><option value="Fri Nov 13, morning (only date)"></option></datalist>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="wp-exp-hint">Prehispanic Cooking Class needs a group of 6+ to confirm. Every other tour needs 4+.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <label class="wp-fl">Nightlife — check any you'd like to join. No group minimum for these</label>
        <div class="wp-checks">
          <label class="wp-check"><input type="checkbox" name="nightlife-drag-show" value="yes"> Drag Spectacular at Somos Voces, Mon Nov 9</label>
          <label class="wp-check"><input type="checkbox" name="nightlife-revuelta" value="yes"> Rooftop Party at Revuelta, Tue Nov 10</label>
          <label class="wp-check"><input type="checkbox" name="nightlife-lucha-libre" value="yes"> Lucha Libre + Tacos, Wed Nov 11</label>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="wp-form-row">
        <div>
          <label class="wp-fl">How many people in your group, including you?</label>
          <select class="wp-fi wp-exp-select" name="group-size" required>
            <option value="" disabled selected>Choose one</option>
            <option value="1">1</option>
            <option value="2">2</option>
            <option value="3">3</option>
            <option value="4">4</option>
            <option value="5">5</option>
            <option value="6">6</option>
            <option value="7">7</option>
            <option value="8">8</option>
            <option value="9+">9+</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div><label class="wp-fl">Group member names (optional)</label><textarea class="wp-fi" name="group-members" rows="2" placeholder="If you know who's joining you, list names here"></textarea></div>
      <div><label class="wp-fl">Anything else we should know?</label><textarea class="wp-fi" name="message" rows="3" required></textarea></div>
      <button type="submit" class="wp-how-cta-btn" style="border:none;cursor:pointer;">Pre-register — no cost</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</div>

</Layout>

<style is:global>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;1,300;1,400;1,600&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap');

  .wp-banner, .wp-hero, .wp-tulum-strip, .wp-range-intro, .wp-section-label, .wp-cards-list, .wp-card, .wp-cta-strip, .wp-faq, .wp-how, .wp-form {
    --wblue: #2e3f52; --wblue-dark: #1e2d3d; --wblue-mid: #3d5068;
    --wbrass: #b8924a; --wbrass-light: #d4b06e; --wbrass-pale: #f0e6d3;
    --wcopper: #9e5a3a; --wcopper-light: #c07a52;
    --wcream: #f2ede4; --wcream-dark: #e8e0d4;
    --wmahogany: #2a1810; --wcobalt: #1e3a5f;
    --wink: #1c1410; --wink-light: #3d3530; --wmuted: #7a6e66;
    --wborder: #d4c9b8; --wwhite: #faf6f0;
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  }

  .wp-banner{position:sticky;top:52px;z-index:90;background:var(--wblue-dark);padding:11px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--wbrass);}
  .wp-banner-text{font-size:14.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);letter-spacing:0.3px;}
  .wp-banner-text strong{color:var(--wbrass-light);font-weight:500;}
  .wp-banner-btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--wbrass);color:var(--wmahogany);padding:8px 18px;border-radius:2px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap;flex-shrink:0;}

  .wp-disclaimer{background:var(--wcream-dark);border-bottom:1px solid var(--wborder);padding:10px 20px;text-align:center;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--wmuted);}

  .wp-hero{background:var(--wblue);position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:52px 24px 48px;}
  .wp-hero-sun{position:absolute;right:-40px;top:-40px;width:280px;height:280px;opacity:0.06;pointer-events:none;}
  .wp-hero::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:4px;background:var(--wcobalt);}
  .wp-hero-inner{max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;z-index:1;}
  .wp-hero-eyebrow{font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--wbrass-light);margin-bottom:6px;}
  .wp-hero-date{font-size:14.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:28px;}
  .wp-hero-title{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:clamp(52px,14vw,88px);font-weight:300;color:var(--wwhite);line-height:0.95;margin-bottom:4px;letter-spacing:-1px;}
  .wp-hero-title-sub{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:clamp(28px,8vw,52px);font-weight:300;font-style:italic;color:var(--wbrass-light);line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:28px;}
  .wp-hero-sub{font-size:18px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);font-weight:300;line-height:1.8;max-width:420px;margin-bottom:36px;}
  .wp-hero-btn{display:block;background:var(--wbrass);color:var(--wmahogany);padding:16px 32px;border-radius:2px;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:2px;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px;text-align:center;max-width:320px;}
  .wp-hero-note{font-size:14.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);font-style:italic;margin-bottom:40px;}
  .wp-guides{display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:14px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .wp-guide{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex:1;min-width:200px;}
  .wp-guide-photo{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center top;flex-shrink:0;border:1px solid var(--wbrass);}
  .wp-guide-label{font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--wbrass);margin-bottom:2px;}
  .wp-guide-text{font-size:14.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);line-height:1.5;font-weight:300;}
  .wp-guide-text strong{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);font-weight:500;}

  .wp-tulum-strip{background:var(--wblue-dark);border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);padding:14px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;text-align:center;}
  .wp-tulum-strip-text{font-size:16px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);}
  .wp-tulum-strip-text strong{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);}
  .wp-tulum-strip-link{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--wbrass-light);text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.3);padding-bottom:1px;}

  .wp-range-intro{background:var(--wcream-dark);border-bottom:1px solid var(--wborder);padding:32px 24px 24px;text-align:center;}
  .wp-range-title{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:clamp(48px,11vw,72px);font-weight:300;letter-spacing:-1px;color:var(--wblue);margin-bottom:14px;}
  .wp-range-intro p:not(.wp-range-title){font-size:16px;color:var(--wmuted);font-weight:300;line-height:1.7;max-width:480px;margin:0 auto;}

  .wp-section-label{background:var(--wcream);border-top:4px solid var(--wblue);border-bottom:1px solid var(--wborder);padding:32px 24px 28px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;}
  .wp-nightlife-label{border-top-color:var(--wcopper);}
  .wp-section-label-title{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:clamp(40px,10vw,72px);font-weight:300;color:var(--wblue);letter-spacing:-2px;line-height:1;}
  .wp-nightlife-title{color:var(--wcopper);}
  .wp-section-label-count{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--wmuted);letter-spacing:0.5px;padding-top:6px;}
  .wp-section-label-cta{font-size:13.5px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--wbrass);margin-top:8px;font-weight:500;display:none;}
  .wp-nightlife-cta{color:var(--wcopper-light);}
  .wp-accordion-arrow{font-size:25.5px;color:var(--wbrass);transition:transform 0.3s ease;line-height:1;flex-shrink:0;padding-top:6px;}
  .wp-nightlife-arrow{color:var(--wcopper);}
  .wp-accordion-cards{overflow:hidden;}

  .wp-card-teaser{font-size:17px;color:var(--wmuted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:300;font-style:italic;}
  .wp-card-toggle-check{position:absolute;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;}
  .wp-card-toggle-label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--wbrass);cursor:pointer;margin-bottom:14px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.5px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.3);padding-bottom:2px;}
  .wp-toggle-icon{font-size:19.5px;line-height:1;transition:transform 0.25s;font-weight:300;}
  .wp-card-toggle-check:checked ~ .wp-card-toggle-label .wp-toggle-icon{transform:rotate(45deg);}
  .wp-card-toggle-check:checked ~ .wp-card-toggle-label .wp-toggle-txt::after{content:'Less';}
  .wp-card-toggle-label .wp-toggle-txt::after{content:'More details';}
  .wp-card-details{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height 0.35s ease;}
  .wp-card-toggle-check:checked ~ .wp-card-details{max-height:300px;}

  .wp-cards-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;background:var(--wcream);}
  .wp-card{background:var(--wwhite);border-bottom:1px solid var(--wborder);position:relative;}
  .wp-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--wbrass) 0%,var(--wbrass-light) 100%);}
  .wp-nightlife-card::before{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--wcopper) 0%,var(--wcopper-light) 100%);}
  .wp-card-photo-wrap{position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:1/1;overflow:hidden;background:var(--wblue);}
  .wp-card-photo{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;}
  .wp-card-tag{position:absolute;bottom:12px;left:12px;background:rgba(30,29,24,0.82);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:1px;}
  .wp-card-date{position:absolute;bottom:12px;right:12px;background:var(--wbrass);color:var(--wmahogany);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:1px;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:1px;}
  .wp-card-body{padding:20px 20px 24px;}
  .wp-card-title{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:27.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--wblue);line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:12px;}
  .wp-nightlife-card .wp-card-title{color:var(--wmahogany);}
  .wp-card-meta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;margin-bottom:14px;padding-bottom:14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--wborder);}
  .wp-card-meta-item{font-size:16px;color:var(--wmuted);line-height:1.4;}
  .wp-card-desc{font-size:17px;color:var(--wink-light);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;font-weight:300;}
  .wp-card-includes{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--wcopper);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:18px;font-weight:400;}
  .wp-card-pending{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--wcopper);font-style:italic;margin-bottom:10px;}
  .wp-card-footer{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .wp-card-price{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:23.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--wblue);line-height:1.2;}
  .wp-card-price small{display:block;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--wmuted);font-weight:300;}
  .wp-card-btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--wblue);color:var(--wwhite);padding:13px 22px;border-radius:2px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;}

  .wp-cta-strip{background:var(--wblue);border-top:3px solid var(--wbrass);padding:36px 24px;text-align:center;}
  .wp-cta-strip-eyebrow{font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--wbrass);margin-bottom:10px;}
  .wp-cta-strip-title{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:33.5px;font-weight:300;color:var(--wwhite);margin-bottom:6px;font-style:italic;}
  .wp-cta-strip-sub{font-size:17px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);margin-bottom:24px;font-weight:300;}
  .wp-cta-strip-btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--wbrass);color:var(--wmahogany);padding:16px 36px;border-radius:2px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;width:100%;max-width:320px;}

  .wp-faq{background:var(--wcream-dark);padding:48px 24px;}
  .wp-faq-eyebrow{font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--wbrass);margin-bottom:8px;}
  .wp-faq-title{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:31.5px;font-weight:400;color:var(--wblue);margin-bottom:32px;}
  .wp-faq-item{border-top:1px solid var(--wborder);}
  .wp-faq-item:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--wborder);}
  .wp-faq-toggle{position:absolute;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;}
  .wp-faq-question{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:18px 0;cursor:pointer;font-size:18px;font-weight:500;color:var(--wink);line-height:1.4;}
  .wp-faq-icon{font-size:23.5px;color:var(--wbrass);flex-shrink:0;transition:transform 0.25s;line-height:1;font-weight:300;}
  .wp-faq-toggle:checked ~ .wp-faq-question .wp-faq-icon{transform:rotate(45deg);}
  .wp-faq-answer{font-size:17px;color:var(--wink-light);line-height:1.8;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height 0.35s ease;font-weight:300;}
  .wp-faq-toggle:checked ~ .wp-faq-answer{max-height:300px;padding-bottom:20px;}

  .wp-how{background:var(--wblue);padding:52px 24px 56px;position:relative;}
  .wp-how::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:4px;background:var(--wcobalt);}
  .wp-how-inner{max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;}
  .wp-how-eyebrow{font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--wbrass);margin-bottom:10px;}
  .wp-how-title{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:clamp(26px,6vw,34px);font-weight:300;font-style:italic;color:var(--wwhite);margin-bottom:40px;line-height:1.2;}
  .wp-how-steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;margin-bottom:40px;}
  .wp-how-step{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:20px;padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);}
  .wp-how-step:first-child{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);}
  .wp-how-num{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:43.5px;font-weight:300;color:var(--wbrass);line-height:1;flex-shrink:0;width:48px;opacity:0.7;}
  .wp-how-step-content{flex:1;padding-top:4px;}
